{"text": "But the king still did not want. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Simpleton for his daughter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now bring me a man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who can eat a mountain of bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the forest Simpleton met a man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who was tightening his belt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I ate a whole oven of bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But I am still hungry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In one day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The man ate. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The whole mountain of bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the king asked for a ship. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That could sail on land and water. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the forest Simpleton met the little gray man again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I drank and ate for you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And now I will give you a ship. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the king saw the ship. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He could not say no anymore. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Simpleton married the princess. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And they had a happy wedding. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After the king died. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Simpleton became king. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And lived happily with his wife.", "alignment": {"characters": ["B", "u", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "s", "t", "i", "l", "l", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "w", "a", "n", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "i", "m", "p", "l", "e", "t", "o", "n", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "d", "a", "u", "g", "h", "t", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "N", "o", "w", " ", "b", "r", "i", "n", "g", " ", "m", "e", " ", "a", " ", "m", "a", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "o", " ", "c", "a", "